# 🚀 SkillBridge | AI Career Intelligence Tool

SkillBridge is a high-end, AI-powered career roadmap generator specifically designed for the Indian job market. It takes a user's current profile (education, skills, and city) and uses Google Gemini AI to provide a brutally honest employability score and a step-by-step "Bridge Path" to their dream job.

## ✨ Features
- **🤖 AI-Powered Analysis:** Uses Google Gemini 1.5 Flash for deep, personalized career insights.
- **🇮🇳 India-Centric:** Specifically tuned for Indian city tiers, local platforms (Naukri, Internshala, etc.), and salary ranges.
- **🌐 Bilingual Support:** Fully functional in both **English** and **Hindi**.
- **📈 Visual Progress:** Interactive skill bars and a step-by-step career bridge.
- **📱 Fully Responsive:** Works perfectly on desktops, tablets, and mobile phones.

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
- **Framework:** [Next.js](https://nextjs.org/) (React)
- **Styling:** Custom CSS (Dark Theme)
- **AI Engine:** [Google Gemini AI](https://aistudio.google.com/)
- **Deployment:** [Vercel](https://vercel.com/)

